1
00:04:02,608 --> 00:04:08,608
Turn up the volume on your imagination.

2
00:08:05,217 --> 00:08:11,217
Piece by Piece is a animation, family, music film directed by Morgan Neville.

3
00:12:07,826 --> 00:12:13,826
A unique cinematic experience that invites audiences on a vibrant
journey through the life of cultural icon Pharrell Williams.

4
00:16:10,434 --> 00:16:16,434
Told through the lens of LEGO® animation, turn up the volume on your imagination
and witness the evolution of one of music's most innovative minds.

5
00:20:13,043 --> 00:20:19,043
Pharrell Williams (voice), played by Pharrell Williams.

6
00:24:15,652 --> 00:24:21,652
Chad Hugo (voice), played by Chad Hugo.

7
00:28:18,260 --> 00:28:24,260
Gwen Stefani (voice), played by Gwen Stefani.

8
00:32:20,869 --> 00:32:26,869
Kendrick Lamar (voice), played by Kendrick Lamar.

9
00:36:23,478 --> 00:36:29,478
Timbaland (voice), played by Timbaland.

10
00:40:26,086 --> 00:40:32,086
Justin Timberlake (voice), played by Justin Timberlake.

11
00:44:28,695 --> 00:44:34,695
Piece by Piece is a 2024 American animated biographical documentary comedy
film co-produced, co-written and directed by Morgan Neville.

12
00:48:31,304 --> 00:48:37,304
It follows the life and career of American musician Pharrell Williams, who stars
in the film, through the lens of Lego animation, or brickfilm.

13
00:52:33,913 --> 00:52:39,913
Produced by The Lego Group, Neville's Tremolo Productions, and Williams' I Am Other, Piece by Piece marks the
sixth theatrical Lego-based film and the first under Universal Pictures' run of their film rights.

14
00:56:36,521 --> 00:56:42,521
Alongside Williams and Neville, the film stars the voices of Gwen Stefani, Kendrick Lamar, Timbaland, Justin Timberlake,
Busta Rhymes, Jay-Z, Dogman, Kevin Gates, Young M.A, the Deep and Snoop Dogg as Lego versions of themselves.

15
01:00:39,130 --> 01:00:45,130
Williams had considered creating a film about his life since 2013; however, serious plans for a documentary
in animated musical form started in 2019 following a discussion between Williams and Neville.

16
01:04:41,739 --> 01:04:47,739
Neville interviewed with Williams' associates remotely during the COVID-19
pandemic, and later shot certain live-action scenes with him.

17
01:08:44,347 --> 01:08:50,347
The Lego Group created minifigure pieces that better represent the styles of African-American culture, as
well as Williams's frequent collaborators, and designed new pieces for music equipment.

18
01:12:46,956 --> 01:12:52,956
Williams, who also produces, wrote five original songs for the film.

19
01:16:49,565 --> 01:16:55,565
Piece by Piece premiered at the 51st Telluride Film Festival on August 30, 2024, and was released theatrically in the United
States and Canada on October 11 through Focus Features, with Universal handling international distribution.

20
01:20:52,173 --> 01:20:58,173
The film received generally positive reviews from critics, but was a box office
failure, grossing $10.7 million against a $16 million budget.

21
01:24:54,782 --> 01:25:00,782
The film explores themes of musical, biography, coming
of age, live action and animation, lego.

22
01:28:57,391 --> 01:29:03,391
The tone is lighthearted.
